# TAA reactive mask (graphics plan 1v, reports/render-features/2026-11-10-taa-reactive/step-1v.md): clips for the
# user's eye, «без маски | с маской». The same scenario four times, 1920x1080 on Ryzen, with the sparks layer of the
# wall torch (reports/content/remaster/wall-torch/particles/content) as the content:
#   OPENGOTHIC_TAA_REACTIVE=0 OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT=<abs content> TEMPEST_WINDOW_SIZE=1920x1080 BENCH_HOST=ryzen \
#     WORLD=NEWWORLD.ZEN scripts/bench.sh scripts/bench/taa-reactive-clips.bench <absolute out>
#   the same with OPENGOTHIC_TAA_REACTIVE=1, with =1 and OPENGOTHIC_TAA_REACTIVE_VIEW=1 (the mask of the same
#   scenes), and with OPENGOTHIC_TAA=0 for the light of the sparks without any history.
# A bench step is 1/30 s, so frame k of each run shows the same moment (the particles' random draws differ).
# Measure with reports/render-features/2026-11-10-taa-reactive/metrics.py.
seed 73013
cheat god
overlay off
ui off
view full
cam lift off
walkmode walk

# 1. The "Red Lantern" torch at night from 2 m along the wall, its sparks: the camera stands
# (wall-torch-particles.bench; the hero is hidden, the crowd that would start a dialogue is cleared)
view hide animated morph
set time 0 0
goto pos 400 -129 -2985
clear 2500
wait 3000
cam look 320
cam world 100 294 90
wait 5000
set time 0 0
wait 300
cam hold
wait 1000
rec rv-1-torch
wait 6000
stop

# 2. The same fire, the camera passes it: the hero walks 2 m away from the wall and back to where he stood (no
# farther: the quay ends there), the camera keeps its offset
cam cut
cam world 100 294 90
face 180
hold forward 1500
wait 2500
face 0
wait 300
rec rv-2-torch-pass
hold forward 1600
wait 2200
stop
view full

# 3. The harbour braziers at noon: fire and smoke against the sky, the water on the left; the camera stands
# (the harbour camera of taa-clips.bench, 5). The same shot is the shore control (5b): the water stays as it was
cam cut
set time 12 0
cam look -2033.524
goto pos -3202.329 1917.000 -3435.690
cam world 5999.906 -2000.000 -155.224859
wait 34
cam hold
wait 6000
set time 12 0
wait 300
rec rv-3-smoke-day
wait 6000
stop

# 4. A fireball at night on the market's cobbles: the hero casts it along the open street at a sheep 12 m ahead; the
# camera stands behind his right shoulder, so the ball flies through the frame and the hit stays in it
cam cut
set time 23 0
goto NW_CITY_MERCHANT_TRADE_04
face wp NW_CITY_MERCHANT_PATH_09
wait 500
clear 2500
stats mana 50000 circle 6
insert Sheep
wait 300
immortal SHEEP on
equip ItRu_InstantFireball
tap spell
wait 1500
pin SHEEP 1200 0 0
cam follow 350 190 210
cam look 150
wait 1500
set time 23 0
rec rv-4-fireball
wait 500
press action
wait 900
tap forward
wait 2500
release action
wait 1100
stop

# 5a. The waterfall below Xardas' tower at noon (animated translucent mesh: marked); the camera stands
cam cut
set time 12 0
goto NW_XARDAS_TOWER_WATERFALL_01
watch player
cam look 150
cam world 700 300 90
wait 6000
cam hold
wait 300
rec rv-5-waterfall
wait 5000
stop
